{"type":"theorem","type_name":"Theorem","number":"7.5.6","title":"The Cuts Form a Complete Ordered Field","title_html":"The Cuts Form a Complete Ordered Field","html":"<p><span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}_{\\mathrm D}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c44\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, with the sum of\n<span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"def-cut-sum\">@def-cut-sum</span>, the\nproduct of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"def-cut-product\">@def-cut-product</span> and the order of\n<span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"def-cut-order\">@def-cut-order</span>,\nis a complete ordered field (<span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"def-complete-ordered-field\">@def-complete-ordered-field</span>).</p>","file":"ch07-reals-dedekind-cuts/05-rationals-inside.html"}